#. ja: Why, if it isn‘t a gathering of my most stalwart adventuring assistants! Or are you perchance participants in a grand convention being held in my honor?
#. de: Why, if it isn't a gathering of my most stalwart adventuring assistants! Or are you perchance participants in a grand convention being held in my honor?
#. fr: Why, if it isn't a gathering of my most stalwart adventuring assistants! Or are you perchance par<shy>ti<shy>ci<shy>pants in a grand convention being held in my honor?
msgctxt "dungeon/000/DungeonFanfesus_00000:TEXT_DUNGEONFANFESUS_00000_HILDIBRAND_000_000:1"
msgid "Why, if it isn't a gathering of my most stalwart adventuring assistants! Or are you perchance participants in a grand convention being held in my honor?"
msgstr "Да это же мои самые верные помощники-авантюристы! Или вы, случаем, участники грандиозного съезда, устроенного в мою честь?"

#. ja: Quickly now, we must depart for Idyllshire! No time to explain why! Nor is there time to explain why I haven‘t time to explain! Go, go!
#. de: Quickly now, we must depart for Idyllshire! No time to explain why! Nor is there time to explain why I haven't time to explain! Go, go!
#. fr: Quickly now, we must depart for Idyllshire! No time to explain why! Nor is there time to explain why I haven't time to explain! Go, go!
msgctxt "dungeon/000/DungeonFanfesus_00000:TEXT_DUNGEONFANFESUS_00000_HILDIBRAND_000_002:1"
msgid "Quickly now, we must depart for Idyllshire! No time to explain why! Nor is there time to explain why I haven't time to explain! Go, go!"
msgstr "Живее, отправляемся в Идиллшир! Некогда объяснять зачем! Да и объяснять, почему мне некогда объяснять, тоже некогда! Скорее, скорее!"
